# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save.
name the Sell dialog places a take-profit: suggested target, refused at or below today's price, shown in Your Portfolio
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 10
click Button
wait 1
show-sell TST
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-TakeProfitSell
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-TakeProfitSell
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitCaption Target price
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 110
expect-text Button Place take-profit
expect-hidden PanelSellStats
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitEstimate Est. proceeds (at target): ₡
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 90
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitEstimate Set the target above today's price
click Button
expect-orders-delta 0
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 120
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint After a sharp rise it can sell for more
expect-no-overflow
capture take-profit-ticket
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 10 shares if the price rises to ₡120
capture take-profit-card
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 10
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
close-economy
